# AKERP Agent Rules

Before changing this repo, read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/AKERP-SYSTEM-GUIDE.pdf` (or the HTML/MD sources).

## Non-negotiables

- One codebase for rental (`Subscription`) and sale (`Perpetual`). Never fork per customer.
- Customize via `company_id` + `CompanyFeature` + `CompanySetting` (+ later custom fields/templates). Never `if (companyName == ...)`.
- UI is Blazor + MudBlazor RTL; Desktop is WebView2 host only.
- Prefer completing Phase 2 (Partners → Inventory → Sales → Purchase) before Phase 4–6 cloud/offline complexity.
- Keep admin flows working: `/companies`, `/users`, `/license`, `/features`.
- Update `AGENTS.md` phase status when a major chunk ships.
